// How many times to retry a git spawn that fails FAST with a signal but no stderr -- the signature
// of the Bun-on-Windows spawn glitch described in gitSpawnBun() below, not a real git error. An
// immediate retry usually clears a transient one; a persistent one exhausts the retries and throws
// an honest, restart-pointing error (and the watchdog heals it). 0 disables. Env-tunable.
